WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.620
(energetic drum music)

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.950
- [Narrator] Mastering an
instrument can take years,

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.933
but not for this drumming prodigy.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.080
- [Narrator] This Great Big
Story was made possible by LEGO.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:24.497
Play Her Way.

00:00:24.497 --> 00:00:27.497
(drumstick tapping)

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:31.620
Nine year-old Yoyoka Soma
took the internet by storm

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:34.220
when a video of her playing
drums to a Led Zeppelin cover

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.358
went viral in 2018.

00:00:36.358 --> 00:00:38.430
♪ Still don't seem to care ♪

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:41.280
- [Narrator] And today, she
has no plans of slowing down.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:55.090
- [Narrator] Yoyoka is the
drummer in her family's band.

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:57.395
They perform all across Japan.

00:00:57.395 --> 00:01:02.395
(audience cheers)
♪ Oh oh oh oh oh oh ♪

00:01:41.202 --> 00:01:44.369
(dramatic drum music)

00:01:45.289 --> 00:01:46.122
(upbeat music)

00:01:46.122 --> 00:01:47.680
- [Narrator] Aside from
playing with her family,

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:49.641
Yoyoka's talent has been
internationally recognized.

00:01:49.641 --> 00:01:52.391
(Ellen laughing)

00:02:35.976 --> 00:02:39.393
(electronic tone chimes)

